@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180

### Catalogue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Customer 4567890 (no membership yet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/4567890

### Example order from the brief: video + book + Book Club membership = 48.50
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4567890,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Order 3344656
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/3344656

### Shipping slips for order 3344656
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/3344656/shipping-slips
